      "text": "[6:10AM] #Surulere\n  #FunsoWilliamsAvenue\n#TrafficUpdate\n\n Dorman-long  bridge inwards Ojuelegba looks  good.\n Dorman-long bridge inwards  Ojuelegba bridge still is good at the moment as well.\n\n Ojuelegba bridge down to Stadium bridge is fair this morning.\nStadium under bridge moves slowly approaching the traffic light.\n Stadium bridge inwards Alaka is better.\n\n Alaka on the service lane is very good, Alaka inwards Iponri, Costain and connecting Eko bridge is not bad either .\n\nThe Return journey from Eko bridge to Alaka, Stadium both main carriage way,  Baracks, Ojuelegba and Dorman-long bridge are looking good.good.\n#FollowLASTMA",
